WEBVTT

00:02.250 --> 00:05.710
Okay, I'm off. I'll be back later.

00:07.500 --> 00:09.790
Make sure you lock the door if you head out, okay?

00:10.040 --> 00:12.210
Y-yeah, I know.

00:12.580 --> 00:14.250
See you later, Mom.

00:16.500 --> 00:17.250
Okay.

00:18.420 --> 00:21.670
It's our turn to head out, Utena.

00:30.540 --> 00:31.830
Here we are.

00:32.460 --> 00:33.460
Behold...

00:35.920 --> 00:38.920
Our headquarters, Nacht Base.

00:41.630 --> 00:46.750
I figured I should give you a tour,
seeing as you're a member of Enormita now.

00:48.210 --> 00:50.880
Wow. Cool.

00:50.880 --> 00:52.920
Yup, evil lairs gotta be cool.

00:53.710 --> 00:56.250
So... where's everyone else?

00:56.250 --> 01:01.170
Our older members are out and about.
I'll introduce you when they get back.

01:02.000 --> 01:04.880
Whaddya think? Pretty nice, huh?

01:05.040 --> 01:06.630
Yeah. Real nice.

01:08.000 --> 01:11.710
So, uh, can I go home now?

01:11.710 --> 01:13.750
Bet you can already guess the answer.

01:13.960 --> 01:17.880
Yeah, c'mon! Hang out a little!

01:20.040 --> 01:22.630
At least make the trip worth it,

01:23.750 --> 01:26.210
Utena Hiiragi-chan.

01:27.500 --> 01:30.000
Wait, how do you know my name?

01:30.170 --> 01:34.540
Vena-chan told me all about you. We gotta be friends!

01:35.710 --> 01:38.130
This is Kiwi. She joined us just before you did.

01:38.460 --> 01:41.790
I'm Kiwi Araga! Nice to meetcha!

03:18.500 --> 03:21.750
<b>The Explosive Leopard!</b>

03:20.290 --> 03:25.290
Damn. You're a hella good escape artist.

03:26.540 --> 03:28.920
Why did you do that?!

03:28.920 --> 03:31.420
Sulfur was so right about you.

03:32.290 --> 03:36.130
I watched your last fight, y'see.

03:36.830 --> 03:40.380
You looked like a total loser, getting beat like that.

03:40.580 --> 03:47.750
And then like, right after, you were smirking
like a total weirdo, Utena-chan.

03:49.250 --> 03:53.130
I would've been pissed.

03:54.290 --> 03:58.420
I would've flown back for a rematch.

04:07.170 --> 04:13.380
But don't worry. I, the great Leoparde,
will beat some sense into you.

04:14.210 --> 04:15.670
Oh no. She's cute.

04:16.330 --> 04:19.170
Mmkay, here we go!

04:31.750 --> 04:35.080
You think that thin little wall's gonna protect you?

04:44.540 --> 04:48.380
Okay, Utena-chan.

04:50.750 --> 04:54.290
Oh, right. Magia Baiser-chan!

04:54.670 --> 05:00.290
Tell me, why do you fight the Tres Magia?

05:01.170 --> 05:05.460
I hate them for stealing the spotlight.

05:06.000 --> 05:09.830
I'm the cutest girl in the whole wide world,

05:09.830 --> 05:13.630
so why does everyone lose their shit
over the Tres Magia?

05:14.460 --> 05:18.000
I need those cows out of the picture.

05:18.670 --> 05:20.380
Your turn, Baiser.

05:20.960 --> 05:23.210
What's your reason?

05:23.210 --> 05:30.880
Why, oh why, oh why, oh why do you fight?

05:31.500 --> 05:34.040
I... I don't...

05:53.080 --> 05:55.380
Wh..what the hell?!

05:59.830 --> 06:08.330
I wouldn't blow that up if I were you.
You'll just end up hurting yourself, Leoparde.

06:10.130 --> 06:14.750
Y'know, I don't actually want to fight.

06:15.250 --> 06:18.250
Not you, not the Tres Magia.

06:19.330 --> 06:23.420
Everyone's so strong and cute.

06:28.460 --> 06:30.460
You're so adorable...

06:31.380 --> 06:34.380
...it makes me wanna bully you!

06:39.290 --> 06:42.080
You wanna know why I was smiling after I lost to Sulfur?

06:42.670 --> 06:49.790
I smiled 'cause I was happy. My heart was so full of joy.

06:51.670 --> 06:59.380
Every time, I see a new side of my darling Tres Magia.
A stronger, even cuter side.

07:01.330 --> 07:05.290
I can't wait to make them writhe and squeal!

07:05.880 --> 07:08.040
Holy shit, you're crazy.

07:12.830 --> 07:17.750
How's that feel? Electrifying, isn't it?!
Doesn't it feel incredible?!

07:18.580 --> 07:20.000
You fucking lunatic!

07:20.710 --> 07:23.750
Don't you want more?
You're just craving more, aren't you?!

07:24.330 --> 07:26.670
How do you like this?!

07:43.040 --> 07:46.330
This feels so good...

07:47.710 --> 07:49.500
...for me, too!

08:04.960 --> 08:09.460
Leoparde... No, Kiwi-chan...

08:12.460 --> 08:16.960
Right now, you are the cutest girl
in the whole entire world.

08:22.170 --> 08:26.460
There we go. Another one of the shackles
around her heart, released.

08:27.080 --> 08:29.290
Everything's going according to plan.

08:30.500 --> 08:32.830
Hey, Utena, we should get going.

08:34.250 --> 08:35.960
Yes, we should.

08:39.290 --> 08:40.460
Kiwi-chan...

08:41.920 --> 08:44.630
I'll see you again soon.

09:04.710 --> 09:05.630
Good morning!

09:05.630 --> 09:06.670
Morning!

09:07.580 --> 09:11.380
I feel like yesterday was the worst one yet...

09:12.170 --> 09:15.920
So why do I feel better than ever?

09:16.460 --> 09:17.670
Utena-chan!

09:18.920 --> 09:21.880
Haruka-chan! G..good morning.

09:21.880 --> 09:23.170
Morning!

09:23.790 --> 09:26.750
Wow, you're like, glowing this morning!

09:26.750 --> 09:29.540
Huh? Uh, thanks?

09:30.880 --> 09:32.920
You ready for finals?

09:32.920 --> 09:37.250
Oh, yeah... They're coming up, huh...?

09:38.960 --> 09:40.960
Utena-chan!

09:44.250 --> 09:45.710
Utena-chan?!

09:46.000 --> 09:47.880
Wh-wha...?

09:49.080 --> 09:51.130
Ki..Kiwi-chan?!

09:53.130 --> 09:55.460
Wh-what are you doing here?

09:53.130 --> 09:56.210
Utena-chan, you okay?!

09:56.210 --> 09:59.540
You said I'd see you again soon!

09:59.540 --> 10:01.790
W-well, yeah, but...

10:03.250 --> 10:05.630
Is that our uniform?

10:05.920 --> 10:08.630
Yup! Now we match!

10:08.920 --> 10:14.000
I just transferred into your school!
We get to be classmates, now!

10:14.580 --> 10:15.250
Wha...?

10:16.130 --> 10:18.750
Utena-chan, let's be BFFs!

10:18.750 --> 10:24.420
Mwah, mwah, mwaaaaaaah! Mwah, mwah! Mwah...!

10:33.130 --> 10:35.920
I got here way too early...

10:37.290 --> 10:40.790
But I've never met up with a friend before...

10:41.130 --> 10:45.330
Utena-chan!

10:47.250 --> 10:51.290
Ki..Kiwi-chan, why do you always tackle me?!

10:52.380 --> 10:56.420
I've been so excited for today to come!

10:56.790 --> 11:00.500
This is gonna be our first date, after all.

11:00.830 --> 11:01.750
Date?!

11:05.380 --> 11:09.880
And you're my first friend ever!
This is our chance to get to know one another!

11:09.880 --> 11:14.750
I wanna know everything about you...
And your body, too.

11:14.750 --> 11:17.040
Wait, my... my what?

11:18.080 --> 11:20.790
OMG, this is so cute!

11:21.080 --> 11:25.290
Utena-chan, let's take a selfie!
This one's goin' up on Snitter!

11:25.710 --> 11:28.460
P-please don't upload any with my face in them!

11:31.380 --> 11:35.040
It's so good. The sugar's taking over my brain.

11:38.210 --> 11:41.330
What's wrong, Utena-chan? Don't like what you got?

11:41.330 --> 11:45.080
Oh, no, I'm just not used to doing this.

11:45.420 --> 11:51.080
I-I mean, like... Eating in front of people
makes me nervous.

11:53.000 --> 11:56.500
So that's why you always eat lunch alone.

11:56.790 --> 11:58.750
H-how did you know that?!

12:00.130 --> 12:02.710
Utena-chan, you're so adorable.

12:03.710 --> 12:05.540
Say "ahh"!

12:09.880 --> 12:13.080
Why'd you do that, Kiwi-chan?!

12:13.080 --> 12:15.290
Aww, you're blushing!

12:30.830 --> 12:33.580
What'd you buy, Utena-chan?

12:34.130 --> 12:37.750
<b>Magia Azure</b>

12:34.130 --> 12:37.750
<b>of the Tres Magia</b>

12:35.170 --> 12:39.630
A figure of Magia Azure. This one just came out.

12:42.040 --> 12:46.710
Come on! Why are we talking about
that stupid titty monster right now?!

12:46.710 --> 12:48.210
S-sorry!

12:49.080 --> 12:54.040
I-I forgot you said you hated the Tres Magia.

12:56.960 --> 13:02.380
Y'know, Utena-chan, you're a lot different
when you're transformed.

13:03.670 --> 13:07.460
During that battle you were acting totally unhinged.

13:07.960 --> 13:09.580
Yeah, well...

13:11.170 --> 13:13.330
I don't really know why, either.

13:13.710 --> 13:20.880
When I transform, I just can't hold back,
even though I know it's wrong.

13:21.130 --> 13:24.710
Of course it's wrong. We ARE the bad guys.

13:25.460 --> 13:29.290
I never wanted to be in Enormita. I got forced into it.

13:29.880 --> 13:31.580
Wow, really?

13:32.460 --> 13:34.420
How'd you join, Kiwi-chan?

13:34.830 --> 13:36.580
Oh, well...

13:42.040 --> 13:44.000
Maybe like this?

13:45.380 --> 13:49.580
OMG, I look so cute! I'm so posting this one!

13:49.580 --> 13:51.380
Gimme those likes!

13:53.000 --> 13:55.420
Yay, got one already!

13:56.880 --> 14:00.880
<b>I ran into</b>

13:56.880 --> 14:00.880
<b>those magical girls!!</b>

13:56.880 --> 14:00.880
<b>They're so cute!</b>

14:01.920 --> 14:04.710
Who the hell are these idiots?
Why's this post popping off?

14:05.290 --> 14:09.330
Ugh, pay more attention to me!

14:09.330 --> 14:11.330
I hate magical girls!

14:14.920 --> 14:16.000
Oh, I know!

14:19.880 --> 14:22.380
I sense a bad guy in the making!

14:30.080 --> 14:31.710
Hey, friendo.

14:31.960 --> 14:33.540
Who the hell are you?

14:34.170 --> 14:36.210
Do you hate magical girls?

14:36.670 --> 14:37.630
Fuck 'em.

14:37.710 --> 14:39.960
Wanna take 'em down?

14:40.130 --> 14:41.290
Hell yeah.

14:41.830 --> 14:44.830
Our evil organization battles magical girls-

14:44.830 --> 14:45.460
I'm in.

14:47.330 --> 14:49.080
And that was that.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.670
That's it?!

14:51.290 --> 14:53.710
But what about world domination?

14:53.830 --> 14:55.630
Don't care about that at all.

14:56.380 --> 15:03.250
But, like, before, I wanted everyone in the world
to tell me how cute I am.

15:04.290 --> 15:10.040
But now, I'm fine just hearing
that compliment from you, Utena-chan.

15:12.290 --> 15:15.130
Oh, hey, Utena-chan!

15:17.670 --> 15:20.790
Let's Trans Magia!

15:24.670 --> 15:25.420
What?

15:26.630 --> 15:31.580
Hey! What...? How'd you make me transform, too?!

15:31.580 --> 15:32.880
Dunno!

15:33.330 --> 15:36.790
Let's celebrate our first date with a special selfie!

15:37.250 --> 15:40.330
We can't! If we tranform here...

15:42.130 --> 15:43.630
It's those villains!

15:43.830 --> 15:45.710
Enormita is here!

15:46.250 --> 15:47.630
See?!

15:47.630 --> 15:49.080
C'mon, pose!

15:49.380 --> 15:52.210
What do you think you're doing, Enormita?!

15:53.580 --> 15:55.580
See? I tried to warn you...

15:56.130 --> 16:00.920
The Tres Magia are here to punish you Enormita goons!

16:01.960 --> 16:05.040
Here I thought I wouldn't have to fight today...

16:05.040 --> 16:09.750
Yeah, yeah, we know. Save the intro for TV.

16:09.750 --> 16:13.380
Oh, right, sorry.

16:13.380 --> 16:15.250
Why the hell are you apologizing to her?

16:15.500 --> 16:18.880
And why are you here?
We haven't even done anything yet.

16:18.880 --> 16:20.210
Wait, really?

16:20.210 --> 16:21.960
Um, Magenta?

16:23.630 --> 16:24.880
Oh?

16:25.460 --> 16:30.920
Talk about a couple of cowards. Fine, then, run along.

16:33.080 --> 16:37.710
Watching you turn tail
will make for fine teatime entertainment.

16:38.170 --> 16:41.750
Oh, you wanna go, bitch? Let's go.

16:45.210 --> 16:45.960
Sulfur!

16:46.790 --> 16:49.040
I'll blow you to pieces!

16:49.920 --> 16:52.540
Sulfur's always so quick to start a fight...

16:53.000 --> 16:54.460
Leoparde-chan...

16:57.250 --> 16:59.040
Looks like it's just you and me.

17:00.420 --> 17:02.790
Yeah. Looks like it.

17:05.960 --> 17:11.080
I know you can't hurt me outside of melee distance!

17:14.920 --> 17:18.580
Those pea shooters of yours can barely touch me.

17:19.420 --> 17:25.130
Man, I can't wait to fuck up your stupid face!

17:32.630 --> 17:34.000
Magia Baiser...

17:34.960 --> 17:39.330
Sulfur was right. I can't tell what she's plotting.

17:39.960 --> 17:41.830
I'd better not let my guard down!

17:42.920 --> 17:45.790
She uses that crop of hers to make monsters.

17:46.670 --> 17:51.080
What'll it be today? What's she going to do to me?

17:51.580 --> 17:55.250
No, stop that! Why am I thinking about that?!

17:57.790 --> 18:00.080
Get your head in the game, Sayo!

18:00.500 --> 18:04.210
I'm Magia Azure! A powerful magical girl
who strikes down evil!

18:10.330 --> 18:12.080
What is wrong with her?!

18:19.290 --> 18:20.630
Blindfolded again!

18:21.460 --> 18:23.420
Now stay put.

18:26.290 --> 18:27.710
Her boobs...

18:29.080 --> 18:31.380
When they're bound like that they're so...

18:32.960 --> 18:34.960
...big and bouncy!

18:42.960 --> 18:44.710
M-my breasts?!

18:49.040 --> 18:50.420
She's touching my breasts?

18:50.960 --> 18:53.290
Wh-what's she going to do?

19:15.080 --> 19:19.130
N-no, not my breasts!

19:20.580 --> 19:21.580
Stop!

19:23.170 --> 19:25.580
Don't play with my breasts!

19:43.920 --> 19:44.880
Dammit!

19:46.580 --> 19:50.920
You're outta shots. That's what you get
for blowing your load all over the place.

19:51.630 --> 19:55.040
That means it's our turn to go on the offensive.

19:55.790 --> 19:59.630
Leoparde-chan's in trouble! Now's no time for games!

20:05.000 --> 20:06.460
Get 'er, Magenta!

20:06.920 --> 20:07.630
Yeah!

20:09.040 --> 20:11.540
Wait, Magenta!

20:16.630 --> 20:17.920
The hell happened?

20:17.920 --> 20:19.500
Azure was right there!

20:22.830 --> 20:25.830
Wait, it's... a figurine?

20:26.830 --> 20:30.080
Another shadow clone? Is that her only move?

20:30.330 --> 20:32.920
Looks like Leoparde and Baiser ran off...

20:35.130 --> 20:37.750
Blue-balling us again...

20:39.500 --> 20:41.670
We should probably help that idiot.

20:42.460 --> 20:43.750
Azure!

20:51.420 --> 20:52.670
Are you okay?

20:53.790 --> 20:58.040
I hate them so much!
They're learning how to counter me!

20:58.710 --> 21:01.630
Thanks for saving me, Utena-chan.

21:02.420 --> 21:04.710
Sorry you lost your figure.

21:05.170 --> 21:09.210
It's okay! I can always buy another.

21:09.500 --> 21:11.040
I'm just glad...

21:12.830 --> 21:15.580
...you made it out okay, Kiwi-chan.

21:23.000 --> 21:24.540
Utena-chan!

21:25.500 --> 21:26.750
Can I have a kissy?

21:28.040 --> 21:32.040
A what?! Wh..what are you talking about, Kiwi-chan?!

21:33.000 --> 21:35.130
I wuv you, Utena!

21:35.330 --> 21:37.170
Let's go make out at a love hotel!

21:37.170 --> 21:38.210
Wh..wha-?!

21:39.250 --> 21:43.170
Just kidding about the love hotel.

21:43.460 --> 21:45.000
Oh, huh.

21:45.130 --> 21:49.170
I sure am pooped after that battle.
Let's go rest somewhere.

21:49.170 --> 21:50.500
Yeah, same.

21:51.210 --> 21:53.750
Ooh, here's perfect.

21:54.750 --> 21:56.000
<b>Hourly Prices</b>

21:54.750 --> 21:56.000
<b>Hourly Prices</b>

21:54.750 --> 21:56.000
<b>Overnight Stay OK</b>

21:54.750 --> 21:56.000
<b>Cosplay</b>

21:56.000 --> 21:57.250
<b>Hotel One Night</b>

21:57.250 --> 21:57.790
<b>Hotel One Night</b>

21:58.170 --> 21:59.000
<b>Hotel One Night</b>

22:00.920 --> 22:03.630
Kiwi-chan, this is a love hotel!

22:03.960 --> 22:05.540
How are you this strong?!

23:36.130 --> 23:41.000
<b>Everyone Loves the Tres Magia!</b>
